  "resume": "This video is a news report from the Swiss Tagesschau broadcast on 5 August 1980, covering the 35th anniversary of the Hiroshima atomic bombing. It shows a peace ceremony in Hiroshima, Japan, including a minute of silence, speeches by Mayor Takeshi Araki and British anti-nuclear activist Philip Noel-Baker, and symbolic acts like the ringing of the Peace Bell and releasing doves."
